      "content": "i get that u cant prescribe stuff but i just need to know the general safety limits so i dont accidentally overdose myself. im a pretty healthy guy and i dont drink much, so i feel like i can handle a bit more than the average person. like if i took 1000mg every 4 hours, would that be too much or is that actually within a safe range for a 24 hour period? i just need a number to work with so i can sleep.",
